OL,3,GNEWSARestoration completed on          
OL,4,A400-year-old gateway                   
OL,6,FCenturies of pollution, water damage   
OL,7,Fand poor repairs had left the Grade    
OL,8,FI-listed structure cracking, with      
OL,9,Fsections falling away.                 
